<title>INDIA: India's HDFC jumps on Q1 97/98 results.</title>
<headline>India's HDFC jumps on Q1 97/98 results.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of the Housing Development Finance Corporation (HDFC) jumped 223.5 rupees, or 5.6 percent, to 4,100 rupees after the firm announced its results for the first quarter of 1997/98 (April-March), dealers said.</p>
<p>The firm said its profit after tax rose to 549.1 million rupees for the three months ended June 30 from 427.2 million.</p>
<p>Disbursals rose 23 percent to 3.38 billion rupees for the period under comparison, it said.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
